update v1.6 03/09/2025
- refactored code allowing linux / debian 64 bit compilation
- refactored code allowing windows 64 bit compilation
- sunset 32bits support windows
- updated sqlite3.dll v3.49.1 to v3.53.3.0
- added .sqlite support same as .db
- added sql import validation first draft still a bit tricky
  gives approximate line number and insert line which errors
- added various data sources in data folder
- refactor srt2sql imports .srt subtitle files
- fixed many small bugs import export related
- rewrite xml2sql function now deals with xml
  with multiline values and variable fields per record
  sample variable fields:
    <country>
        <code>fi</code>
        <handle>finland</handle>
        <continent>europe</continent>
        <iso>246</iso>
        <name>Finland</name>
    </country>
    <country>
        <code>fr</code>
        <handle>france</handle>
        <continent>europe</continent>
        <alt>Francaise</alt>
        <iso>250</iso>
        <name>France</name>
    </country>
  note the alt node in the record france
  sample multi line field value:
   <book id="bk103">
      <author>Corets, Eva</author>
      <title>Maeve Ascendant</title>
      <genre>Fantasy</genre>
      <price>5.95</price>
      <publish_date>2000-11-17</publish_date>
      <description>After the collapse of a nanotechnology
      society in England, the young survivors lay the
      foundation for a new society.</description>
   </book>
  note the multi line value in node description

